{
    "title": "Taxi Run: Traffic Driver",
    "description": "Breakneck speed to get your adrenaline pumping!\r\n\r\nWelcome to the exciting world of Taxi Run: Crazy Driver! This game is not just a taxi game, it is a perfect taxi simulator in which you become a driver of an extraordinary taxi. Immerse yourself in the dynamic world of car racing and experience a real drive!\r\n\r\nAs a taxi driver you have to go through a series of incredible challenges. Get ready for endless races full of adrenaline and high speeds! Taxi game offers you to ride on endless roads avoiding obstacles and competing against time.\r\n\r\nTaxi Run: Crazy Driver opens up a world of possibilities for you. Your task is not just to be a taxi driver, but to become the best in this business. Get ready to dive into taxi racing that will test your ability to maneuver through obstacles and stay in first place even when the speed is off the charts.\r\n\r\nHurry up? Then taxi games are for you! Our taxi simulator will give you the opportunity to drive various cars, enjoy car racing and improve your driving skills to become the best. Feel the drive and speed in every race as the taxi driver overcomes all the obstacles on the way!\r\n\r\nWhy you'll love Taxi Run: Traffic Driver taxi games:\r\n- Easy taxi car game controls\r\n- Fun car games taxi tasks\r\n- Cool taxi game graphics\r\n- Simple taxi games interface\r\n- Car games taxi action to get your heart racing\r\n\r\nThis is not just a taxi game and a taxi simulator, it is a test of your reaction, attention and ingenuity. Taxi Run: Crazy Driver is endless racing, dynamic chases, incredible challenges and the atmosphere of a real drive. Get involved in taxi racing and become the best in taxi games! Speed, adrenaline and chase await you in the taxi game. Enjoy and keep driving!\r\n\r\n=====================\r\n<strong>COMPANY COMMUNITY:</strong> \r\n=====================\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/AzurGamesOfficial\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/azur_games\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/AzurInteractiveGames",
    "descriptionHTML": "Breakneck speed to get your adrenaline pumping!<br><br>Welcome to the exciting world of Taxi Run: Crazy Driver! This game is not just a taxi game, it is a perfect taxi simulator in which you become a driver of an extraordinary taxi. Immerse yourself in the dynamic world of car racing and experience a real drive!<br><br>As a taxi driver you have to go through a series of incredible challenges. Get ready for endless races full of adrenaline and high speeds! Taxi game offers you to ride on endless roads avoiding obstacles and competing against time.<br><br>Taxi Run: Crazy Driver opens up a world of possibilities for you. Your task is not just to be a taxi driver, but to become the best in this business. Get ready to dive into taxi racing that will test your ability to maneuver through obstacles and stay in first place even when the speed is off the charts.<br><br>Hurry up? Then taxi games are for you! Our taxi simulator will give you the opportunity to drive various cars, enjoy car racing and improve your driving skills to become the best. Feel the drive and speed in every race as the taxi driver overcomes all the obstacles on the way!<br><br>Why you&#39;ll love Taxi Run: Traffic Driver taxi games:<br>- Easy taxi car game controls<br>- Fun car games taxi tasks<br>- Cool taxi game graphics<br>- Simple taxi games interface<br>- Car games taxi action to get your heart racing<br><br>This is not just a taxi game and a taxi simulator, it is a test of your reaction, attention and ingenuity. Taxi Run: Crazy Driver is endless racing, dynamic chases, incredible challenges and the atmosphere of a real drive. Get involved in taxi racing and become the best in taxi games! Speed, adrenaline and chase await you in the taxi game. Enjoy and keep driving!<br><br>=====================<br><strong>COMPANY COMMUNITY:</strong> <br>=====================<br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/AzurGamesOfficial<br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/azur_games<br>YouTube